          "title": "Common Mistakes in Production Observability",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Logging and Request IDs",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`print()` or `basicConfig` after Uvicorn starts: handlers ==duplicated or ignored==",
                "Use `dictConfig`, set `disable_existing_loggers` False, set `propagate` on purpose",
                "Request ID in a plain global: IDs ==leak between concurrent requests=="
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "import contextvars",
                "request_id = contextvars.ContextVar(\"request_id\", default=\"-\")",
                "request_id.set(rid)  # in middleware"
              ],
              "note": "a ContextVar is isolated per request"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Probes and Shutdown",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Liveness checks the DB: outage causes a ==restart storm==",
                "Readiness never fails at shutdown: ==dropped requests=="
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
